---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: 現代史
---

<article class="history-page">
  <header class="history-header">
    <h1>現代史</h1>
    <p>
      現代史と、世界線"FANG"における出来事を同一時間軸上にて示す。
    </p>
    <p>
      現代史の選定基準は恣意的であり、作者の興味に応じて増減する。
    </p>
  </header>

  <section class="scaled-timeline" aria-label="FANG historical timeline">
    <div class="scaled-timeline__canvas">
      <div class="scaled-timeline__axis" aria-hidden="true"></div>

      {% for era in historyTimeline.eras %}
        <section
          class="scaled-era scaled-era--{{ era.name }}"
          style="
            top: {{ era.startDate | timelineDatePosition(historyTimeline.startDate, historyTimeline.endDate) }}%;
            height: {{ 
              (era.endDate | timelineDatePosition(historyTimeline.startDate, historyTimeline.endDate))
              -
              (era.startDate | timelineDatePosition(historyTimeline.startDate, historyTimeline.endDate))
            }}%;
          "
        >
          <h2>{{ era.name }}</h2>
        </section>
      {% endfor %}

      {% for event in collections.historyTimelineEvents %}
        {% set eventDate = event | eventDateValue %}

        <article
            class="scaled-event scaled-event--{{ event.type }} scaled-event--{{ event.side or 'fang' }}"
            style="
            top: {{ eventDate | timelineDatePosition(historyTimeline.startDate, historyTimeline.endDate) }}%;
            --lane: {{ event.lane or 1 }};
            "
        >
            <div class="scaled-event__marker" aria-hidden="true"></div>

            <div class="scaled-event__body">
            <time class="scaled-event__date">
                {{ event | eventDateLabel }}
            </time>

            <h3 class="scaled-event__title">
                {% if event.url %}
                <a href="{{ event.url }}">{{ event.title }}</a>
                {% else %}
                {{ event.title }}
                {% endif %}
            </h3>

            {% if event.person %}
                <p class="scaled-event__person">
                {{ event.person }}
                </p>
            {% endif %}

            {% if event.description %}
                <p class="scaled-event__description">
                {{ event.description }}
                </p>
            {% endif %}
            </div>
        </article>
        {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>
</article>